Maristella,

What shows up in the output if you just run

sem(sem_model, data=ds1)

Also, as general practice, I recommend

model_sem <- sem(sem_model, data=ds1)

over

model_sem = sem(sem_model, data=ds1)

For assignment statements in R, since '=' hasother purposes.

Pat

