Subject: Latent Growth Curve Model: covariates and differences between growth & sem functions
Message-ID: <VDhKHBqcOCQ.mS1LVv2vAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/VDhKHBqcOCQ/m/mS1LVv2vAQAJ>
